window.CARDS=window.CARDS||{};CARDS["people-komiya-kyogo"]=[{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v3-p105-1","v":"y1v3","y":1,"o":3,"k":"action spoken","w":"ike-kanji kondou-reo komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo ch 3 sec  3 1  the campsite visit strides into the class d campsite with kondo  chips and soda in hand  smug grins on   wow  you class d rejects are really living frugal  eh  i guess that s what i d expect from a class of defectives  the translation voices the taunt and the whole visit to the pair without saying which of them speaks  tosses a bag of potato chips near ike s feet and keeps snacking for ten minutes until hirata s group returns   we have a message from ryuuen san  if you want to enjoy your summer vacation to the fullest  come to the beach right now  don t hang back  if you re sick of living like idiots  then we re happy to share our luxuries  bait him directly  he snaps and they ignore him  enters with kondo  their voices are never separated on these pages  the pair who once fought sudo  recalled as acting on ryuen s orders rather than looking for a fight","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v3-p105-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3 sec. 3.1: the campsite visit<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V3 · p.105–106<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Strides into the Class D campsite with Kondō, chips and soda in hand, smug grins on.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a> · <a href=\"index.html#kondou-reo\">Kondō Reo<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Wow, you Class D rejects are really living frugal, eh? I guess that&#x27;s what I&#x27;d expect from a class of defectives.”<span class=\"pg\">p.105<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“We have a message from Ryuuen-san. If you want to enjoy your summer vacation to the fullest, come to the beach right now. Don&#x27;t hang back. If you&#x27;re sick of living like idiots, then we&#x27;re happy to share our luxuries.”<span class=\"pg\">p.106<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The translation voices the taunt and the whole visit to the pair without saying which of them speaks.<span class=\"pg\">p.105<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Tosses a bag of potato chips near Ike&#x27;s feet and keeps snacking for ten minutes until Hirata&#x27;s group returns.<span class=\"pg\">p.105–106<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Bait him directly; he snaps and they ignore him.<span class=\"pg\">p.105–106<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kondō Reo<\/b> Enters with Kondō; their voices are never separated on these pages.<span class=\"pg\">p.105<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Backstory<\/span> The pair who once fought Sudō, recalled as acting on Ryūen&#x27;s orders rather than looking for a fight.<span class=\"pg\">p.105<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v5-p100-1","v":"y1v5","y":1,"o":6,"k":"","w":"sudou-ken komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo ch 6 sec  6  passing mention named with sakazaki as one of the class c students from the earlier fight with sudou  assembled for capture the flag  recalled among those involved in the fight that almost got sudou expelled  sakazaki is named on the same page but has no roster row  only komiya appears here","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v5-p100-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 sec. 6: passing mention<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V5 · p.100<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named with Sakazaki as one of the Class C students from the earlier fight with Sudou, assembled for capture the flag.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Recalled among those involved in the fight that almost got Sudou expelled.<span class=\"pg\">p.100<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Sakazaki is named on the same page but has no roster row; only Komiya appears here.<span class=\"pg\">p.100<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v5-p120-1\">→ After: Ch.6 sec. 6: passing mention<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v5-p120-1","v":"y1v5","y":1,"o":6,"k":"","w":"horikita-suzune komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo ch 6 sec  6  passing mention named as one of the three class d horsemen supporting horikita s jockey in the girls  cavalry  horse under her  the unit holds until four enemy horsemen commit to the jockey  no separate action is shown for him on these pages beyond the formation","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v5-p120-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 sec. 6: passing mention<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V5 · p.120<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named as one of the three Class D horsemen supporting Horikita’s jockey in the girls’ cavalry.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Horse under her; the unit holds until four enemy horsemen commit to the jockey.<span class=\"pg\">p.120<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> No separate action is shown for him on these pages beyond the formation.<span class=\"pg\">p.120<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v5-p100-1\">← Before: Ch.6 sec. 6: passing mention<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v6-p136-1","v":"y1v6","y":1,"o":7,"k":"","w":"ryuuen-kakeru komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo ch 6 sec  6 1  named among the goons named as one of the evergreen trio of goons standing behind ryuuen when the study group s cup is crushed  enforcer in the cafe crash  no dialogue from him on these pages  present only in the roll call of ryuuen s party","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v6-p136-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 sec. 6.1: named among the goons<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V6 · p.136<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named as one of the evergreen trio of goons standing behind Ryuuen when the study group’s cup is crushed.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Enforcer in the café crash; no dialogue from him on these pages.<span class=\"pg\">p.136<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Present only in the roll-call of Ryuuen’s party.<span class=\"pg\">p.136<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p17-1","v":"y1v7","y":1,"o":8,"k":"","w":"ryuuen-kakeru miyake-akito ayanokouji-kiyotaka komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo ch 2  the class c follower at the mall named as ryuuen s henchman watching the keyaki mall group from just far enough away to deny it  sat at a distance so confrontation would label class d the aggressors  ayanokoji reads him as monitoring the group while keeping plausible deniability  follows the group toward the restaurant once ayanokoji peels off to the bathroom  his man on the mall tail  one of the two who showed up at archery club to glare  target of the watch  uses the bathroom ruse to break the line of sight","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p17-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: the Class C follower at the mall<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7 · p.17–18, 28<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named as Ryuuen’s henchman watching the Keyaki Mall group from just far enough away to deny it.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Sat at a distance so confrontation would label Class D the aggressors.<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ayanokōji reads him as monitoring the group while keeping plausible deniability.<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Follows the group toward the restaurant once Ayanokōji peels off to the bathroom.<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> His man on the mall tail.<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> One of the two who showed up at archery club to glare.<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Target of the watch; uses the bathroom ruse to break the line of sight.<span class=\"pg\">p.17–18, 28<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p50-1\">→ After: Ch.3: still at the mall<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p50-1","v":"y1v7","y":1,"o":8,"k":"","w":"miyake-akito hasebe-haruka ryuuen-kakeru komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo ch 3  still at the mall named by miyake as present both yesterday and today at keyaki mall  class c student around late afternoons when miyake finishes club  haruka spat  gross  looking at him  the group agrees not to react  the observer who names the pattern  disgust without disguise  his man on the mall watch","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p50-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: still at the mall<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7 · p.50–51<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named by Miyake as present both yesterday and today at Keyaki Mall.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a> · <a href=\"hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Class C student around late afternoons when Miyake finishes club.<span class=\"pg\">p.50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Haruka spat “Gross” looking at him; the group agrees not to react.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> The observer who names the pattern.<span class=\"pg\">p.50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Disgust without disguise.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> His man on the mall watch.<span class=\"pg\">p.50<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p17-1\">← Before: Ch.2: the Class C follower at the mall<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p65-1\">→ After: Ch.3 half2: not named in the second half<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p65-1","v":"y1v7","y":1,"o":8,"k":"","w":"komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo ch 3 half2  not named in the second half not named in the second half of this chapter","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p65-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3 half2: not named in the second half<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7 · p.65–97<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Not named in the second half of this chapter.<span class=\"pg\">p.65–97<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p50-1\">← Before: Ch.3: still at the mall<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p98-1\">→ After: Ch.4: in the raid party<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p98-1","v":"y1v7","y":1,"o":8,"k":"","w":"ryuuen-kakeru kondou-reo komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo ch 4  in the raid party named with kondou as part of ryuuen s classroom storm  follower in the class d visit  the pair inside the door","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p98-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: in the raid party<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7 · p.98<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"index.html#kondou-reo\">Kondō Reo<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Named with Kondou as part of Ryuuen’s classroom storm.<span class=\"pg\">p.98<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Follower in the Class D visit.<span class=\"pg\">p.98<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kondō Reo<\/b> The pair inside the door.<span class=\"pg\">p.98<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p65-1\">← Before: Ch.3 half2: not named in the second half<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p138-1\">→ After: Ch.5 half2: the upperclassmen dead end<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p138-1","v":"y1v7","y":1,"o":8,"k":"","w":"kondou-reo ryuuen-kakeru komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo ch 5 half2  the upperclassmen dead end named with kondou as students who once asked upperclassmen for exam hints and got nothing   felt like asking was not even allowed  the pair who hit the same wall  evidence he cites for the school s silent generation rule","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p138-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5 half2: the upperclassmen dead end<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7 · p.138<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"index.html#kondou-reo\">Kondō Reo<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Named with Kondou as students who once asked upperclassmen for exam hints and got nothing — felt like asking was not even allowed.<span class=\"pg\">p.138<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kondō Reo<\/b> The pair who hit the same wall.<span class=\"pg\">p.138<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Evidence he cites for the school’s silent-generation rule.<span class=\"pg\">p.138<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p98-1\">← Before: Ch.4: in the raid party<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p176-1\">→ After: Ch.6: on the beaten-into-obedience list<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p176-1","v":"y1v7","y":1,"o":8,"k":"","w":"ibuki-mio ryuuen-kakeru ayanokouji-kiyotaka kondou-reo yamada-albert komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo ch 6  on the beaten into obedience list named by ibuki among the classmates ryuuen beat until they obeyed  later as one of the tails on class d   ishizaki  komiya  kondou  even albert  you beat every single one of them until they were ready to obey you at all times  ayanokoji   you had ishizaki  komiya  and the others tail class d students  the accuser who lists him  the boss who beat him and used him as a tail  counts the tails as part of the trap arithmetic  named in the same list  same list","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p176-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: on the beaten-into-obedience list<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7 · p.176, 181<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named by Ibuki among the classmates Ryuuen beat until they obeyed; later as one of the tails on Class D.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ibuki-mio.html\">Ibuki Mio<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"index.html#kondou-reo\">Kondō Reo<\/a> · <a href=\"yamada-albert.html\">Yamada Albert<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “Ishizaki. Komiya. Kondou. Even Albert. You beat every single one of them until they were ready to obey you at all times,”<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ayanokōji: “You had Ishizaki, Komiya, and the others tail Class D students.”<span class=\"pg\">p.181<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ibuki Mio<\/b> The accuser who lists him.<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> The boss who beat him and used him as a tail.<span class=\"pg\">p.176, 181<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Counts the tails as part of the trap arithmetic.<span class=\"pg\">p.181<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kondō Reo<\/b> Named in the same list.<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamada Albert<\/b> Same list.<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7-p138-1\">← Before: Ch.5 half2: the upperclassmen dead end<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7_5-p54-1","v":"y1v7.5","y":1,"o":9,"k":"spoken","w":"ishizaki-daichi ryuuen-kakeru komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo ch 3  walking with ishizaki one of the three class c boys passing ayanokoji and ibuki   about earlier did you really get into it with ryuuen san  for real   that s a relief  man  but wait  who s gonna come up with strategies and stuff  asks him about the ryuuen fight  fearful of the boss s temper  relieved by the cover story","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y1v7_5-p54-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: walking with Ishizaki<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7.5 · p.54<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">One of the three Class C boys passing Ayanokōji and Ibuki.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“About earlier…did you really get into it with Ryuuen-san? For real?”<span class=\"pg\">p.54<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“That’s a relief, man. But wait. Who’s gonna come up with strategies and stuff?”<span class=\"pg\">p.54<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Asks him about the Ryuuen fight.<span class=\"pg\">p.54<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Fearful of the boss’s temper; relieved by the cover story.<span class=\"pg\">p.54<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v2-p172-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"shinohara-satsuki ike-kanji ishizaki-daichi komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo komiya finds her on the steps he spots her stopped on the steps with red eyes  walks with her at her pace  she opens up a crack   satsuki   what s wrong  are you crying   well  because your eyes are red   by the way  i heard from sudo kun that you re gonna be a regular on the basketball team   yeah you always practice until late at night  so i d be lying if i said you       didn t deserve it  he keeps her company at the cafe  ike can t watch  he invited her the day after the rules dropped  the group is him  her and kinoshita minori of class b  he told ishizaki he ll confess on the island  he is the one who gets the seat beside her  his silent defeat is witnessed  he unknowingly briefs him via the pact question","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v2-p172-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Komiya finds her on the steps<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.172–177<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He spots her stopped on the steps with red eyes; walks with her at her pace; she opens up a crack. He keeps her company at the café; Ike can&#x27;t watch.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a> · <a href=\"ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a> · <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Satsuki.”<span class=\"pg\">p.172<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“What’s wrong? Are you crying?”<span class=\"pg\">p.172<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Well, because your eyes are red.”<span class=\"pg\">p.172<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “By the way, I heard from Sudo-kun that you’re gonna be a regular on the basketball team?”<span class=\"pg\">p.172<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Yeah you always practice until late at night, so I’d be lying if I said you …  …  didn’t deserve it.”<span class=\"pg\">p.173<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> He invited her the day after the rules dropped; the group is him, her and Kinoshita Minori of Class B; he told Ishizaki he&#x27;ll confess on the island.<span class=\"pg\">p.168–193<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> He is the one who gets the seat beside her.<span class=\"pg\">p.172–177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> His silent defeat is witnessed.<span class=\"pg\">p.172–186<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> He unknowingly briefs him via the pact question.<span class=\"pg\">p.193<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v2-p194-1\">→ After: Coverage note: passing mentions<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v2-p194-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo coverage note  passing mentions  that komiya guy  he s planning to confess to shinohara on the uninhabited island   i expressed my concerns to horikita about the current situation between ike  shinohara  and komiya and that it might affect this upcoming uninhabited island exam   it seems like komiya and shinohara have already agreed to form a group  but because of your orders  they haven t confirmed yet   the prospect of forming groups for the uninhabited island exam would be difficult","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v2-p194-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Coverage note: passing mentions<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.194–197<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “That Komiya guy, he’s planning to confess to Shinohara on the uninhabited island.”<span class=\"pg\">p.194<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “I expressed my concerns to Horikita about the current situation between Ike, Shinohara, and Komiya and that it might affect this upcoming uninhabited island exam.”<span class=\"pg\">p.195<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “It seems like Komiya and Shinohara have already agreed to form a group, but because of your orders, they haven’t confirmed yet.”<span class=\"pg\">p.196<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “The prospect of forming groups for the uninhabited island exam would be difficult.”<span class=\"pg\">p.197<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v2-p172-1\">← Before: Komiya finds her on the steps<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4-p10-1","v":"y2v4","y":2,"o":19,"k":"","w":"komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo komiya mentioned in passing  back when shinohara senpai s group was attacked and komiya senpai and kinoshita senpai retired from the exam  do you remember how you left to climb the slope with ike senpai    amasawa to ayanokoji   you also hurt komiya senpai and kinoshita senpai  didn t you    nanase accuses amasawa of the cliff attack   since shinohara herself had testified that they had been attacked by someone  the school would definitely investigate the case in detail    shinohara s testimony forces an investigation   what s more  komiya and kinoshita didn t even testify that they had been attacked in the first place  and shinohara herself had only been able to make a vague statement  unable to say who it was she saw   back when komiya and kinoshita were attacked  i found some footprints nearby the scene of the crime  from what i can tell  i m fairly confident that they re the same size as amasawa s    ayanokoji to nanase   in other words  amasawa had definitely been there  just like nanase claimed she was   from what we knew  someone had pushed komiya and kinoshita down the slope  and  judging from the fact that there were no other gps signals in the area at the time  it was clear that it had been a premeditated attack  rather than something done in the heat of the moment","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4-p10-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Komiya mentioned in passing<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4 · p.10–14, 21–26, 32<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “Back when Shinohara-senpai’s group was attacked and Komiya-senpai and Kinoshita-senpai retired from the exam, do you remember how you left to climb the slope with Ike-senpai?” — Amasawa to Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “You also hurt Komiya-senpai and Kinoshita-senpai, didn’t you?” — Nanase accuses Amasawa of the cliff attack.<span class=\"pg\">p.11<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “Since Shinohara herself had testified that they had been attacked by someone, the school would definitely investigate the case in detail.” — Shinohara’s testimony forces an investigation.<span class=\"pg\">p.13<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “What’s more, Komiya and Kinoshita didn’t even testify that they had been attacked in the first place, and Shinohara herself had only been able to make a vague statement, unable to say who it was she saw.”<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “Back when Komiya and Kinoshita were attacked, I found some footprints nearby the scene of the crime. From what I can tell, I’m fairly confident that they’re the same size as Amasawa’s.” — Ayanokōji to Nanase.<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “In other words, Amasawa had definitely been there, just like Nanase claimed she was.”<span class=\"pg\">p.23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “From what we knew: someone had pushed Komiya and Kinoshita down the slope. And, judging from the fact that there were no other GPS signals in the area at the time, it was clear that it had been a premeditated attack, rather than something done in the heat of the moment.”<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4-p31-1\">→ After: Komiya mentioned in passing<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4-p31-1","v":"y2v4","y":2,"o":19,"k":"","w":"komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo komiya mentioned in passing  i convinced myself that amasawa san was the one who pushed komiya senpai and kinoshita senpai down the slope    nanase   i do have a pretty good idea which table everyone belongs to    ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4-p31-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Komiya mentioned in passing<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4 · p.31, 34<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “I convinced myself that Amasawa-san was the one who pushed Komiya-senpai and Kinoshita-senpai down the slope.” — Nanase.<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “I do have a pretty good idea which Table everyone belongs to.” — Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4-p10-1\">← Before: Komiya mentioned in passing<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4-p56-1\">→ After: Komiya mentioned in passing<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4-p56-1","v":"y2v4","y":2,"o":19,"k":"","w":"komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo komiya mentioned in passing  whereupon she was informed of komiya and kinoshita s retirement    narrated  sakayanagi told horikita","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4-p56-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Komiya mentioned in passing<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4 · p.56–57<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “whereupon she was informed of Komiya and Kinoshita’s retirement.” — narrated; Sakayanagi told Horikita.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4-p31-1\">← Before: Komiya mentioned in passing<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4_5-p26-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"spoken","w":"ike-kanji ryuuen-kakeru ayanokouji-kiyotaka komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo shinohara confession report  the infirmary visit ike and ayanokoji arrive at the infirmary and find ryuen s group  albert  kaneda  kondo  yamawaki  leaving komiya s room  komiya  leg fixed in a brace  welcomes them and asks after his condition   well  he certainly has that power  despite appearances  he just came to visit me   but somethin  about ryuen san s changed a little bit  he s become a bit more mellow or maybe not   if it s that guy from now  i feel like i can honestly follow him  you know   as you can see  i m fine except for my leg   i m in the process of asking for permission to walk on crutches   ryuen san s trying to figure out who pushed me during the exam  he asked me a bunch of questions to see if i remembered anything  but just like i told ayanokoji  i don t even remember being attacked at all   if you make satsuki cry  i ll show you no mercy   satsuki s had her eye on you for a while  that s why she accepted your confession   i m against it  to be honest  i d rather chalk this one up as an accident caused by my own mistake  cheerful and nostalgic despite his injury  his memory of the attack never returned  ryuen s visit softened his image of him   he now believes he can follow ryuen honestly  his rival in love  accepts the confession gracefully  grabs ike s shoulder  presses a fist to his chest and extracts a promise that he won t make shinohara cry  ryuen visited him in person  snacks and juice were left at his bedside  he worries ryuen will go too far hunting the culprit  asks him to keep an eye on ryuen s culprit hunt in case shinohara saw the attacker  they exchange contact information  the same scene is recorded in duplicate form in the other rostered file komiya md  that file tracks year 2  vol  3 only  the two roster rows for komiya are a pre existing duplication flagged to the owner  not resolved here","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4_5-p26-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Shinohara confession report; the infirmary visit<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.26–35<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ike and Ayanokōji arrive at the infirmary and find Ryūen&#x27;s group (Albert, Kaneda, Kondō, Yamawaki) leaving Komiya&#x27;s room; Komiya, leg fixed in a brace, welcomes them and asks after his condition.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Well, he certainly has that power. Despite appearances, he just came to visit me.”<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“But somethin’ about Ryūen-san’s changed a little bit. He’s become a bit more mellow…or maybe not…”<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“If it’s that guy from now, I feel like I can honestly follow him, you know?”<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>11 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “As you can see, I’m fine except for my leg.”<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I’m in the process of asking for permission to walk on crutches.”<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Ryūen-san’s trying to figure out who pushed me during the exam. He asked me a bunch of questions to see if I remembered anything, but just like I told Ayanokōji, I don’t even remember being attacked at all…”<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “If you make Satsuki cry, I’ll show you no mercy.”<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Satsuki’s had her eye on you for a while, that’s why she accepted your confession.”<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I’m against it. To be honest, I’d rather chalk this one up as an accident caused by my own mistake.”<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Cheerful and nostalgic despite his injury; his memory of the attack never returned; Ryūen&#x27;s visit softened his image of him — he now believes he can follow Ryūen honestly.<span class=\"pg\">p.29–30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> His rival in love; accepts the confession gracefully, grabs Ike&#x27;s shoulder, presses a fist to his chest and extracts a promise that he won&#x27;t make Shinohara cry.<span class=\"pg\">p.31–32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Ryūen visited him in person; snacks and juice were left at his bedside; he worries Ryūen will go too far hunting the culprit.<span class=\"pg\">p.28–30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Asks him to keep an eye on Ryūen&#x27;s culprit hunt in case Shinohara saw the attacker; they exchange contact information.<span class=\"pg\">p.33–34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The same scene is recorded in duplicate form in the other rostered file komiya.md (that file tracks Year 2, Vol. 3 only); the two roster rows for Komiya are a pre-existing duplication flagged to the owner, not resolved here.<span class=\"pg\">p.28–35<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4_5-p178-1\">→ After: Mentions: the culprit hunt front<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4_5-p178-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"","w":"komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo mentions  the culprit hunt front ryuen was  looking for the culprit who injured komiya and the others   komiya was injured  i m lookin  for the one who did it  ryuen to nanase   the first ones to arrive at the crime scene were sudo  ayanokoji  ike  hondo and also you   but the komiya situation has nothing to do with kurachi   there is a witness to komiya senpai s case that you don t know about  ryuen senpai   i don t mind telling you who that person is","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4_5-p178-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Mentions: the culprit hunt front<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.178, 183–185, 190–191<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Ryūen was &quot;looking for the culprit who injured Komiya and the others.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.178<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> &quot;Komiya was injured. I&#x27;m lookin&#x27; for the one who did it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.183<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Ryūen to Nanase: &quot;The first ones to arrive at the crime scene were Sudō, Ayanokōji, Ike, Hondō and also you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.184<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> &quot;But the Komiya situation has nothing to do with Kurachi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.185<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> &quot;there is a witness to Komiya-senpai&#x27;s case that you don&#x27;t know about, Ryūen-senpai.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> &quot;I don&#x27;t mind telling you who that person is.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.191<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v4_5-p26-1\">← Before: Shinohara confession report; the infirmary visit<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v5-p142-1","v":"y2v5","y":2,"o":21,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru ishizaki-daichi komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo komiya  the compliance chorus  hey  there s nothing to be gained by hiding opinions  is there   it s not like we re going to get mad at you for voting in favour once   it s not like you were being told what to do  it was your personal choice to vote for or against  right  adjacent narration   komiya explains that they can t be blamed for that  and just to be sure  he checks with ryuen to make sure he s right  however  when ryuen didn t respond immediately  it caused a moment of tension in komiya  democracy s costumed advocate   exhorts the silent  in favour  voters to come forward under the guise of fairness  his check in backfires into a frozen second of fear  both prod the class toward compliance","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v5-p142-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Komiya: the compliance chorus<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V5 · p.142<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Hey, there&#x27;s nothing to be gained by hiding opinions, is there?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.142<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It&#x27;s not like we&#x27;re going to get mad at you for voting in favour once.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.142<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It&#x27;s not like you were being told what to do. It was your personal choice to vote for or against, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.142<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Adjacent narration: &quot;Komiya explains that they can&#x27;t be blamed for that, and just to be sure, he checks with Ryūen to make sure he&#x27;s right. However, when Ryūen didn&#x27;t respond immediately, it caused a moment of tension in Komiya.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.142<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Democracy&#x27;s costumed advocate — exhorts the silent &quot;in favour&quot; voters to come forward under the guise of fairness.<span class=\"pg\">p.142<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> His check-in backfires into a frozen second of fear.<span class=\"pg\">p.142<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Both prod the class toward compliance.<span class=\"pg\">p.142<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v5-p172-1\">→ After: Komiya: mentioned in the spear<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v5-p172-1","v":"y2v5","y":2,"o":21,"k":"","w":"komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo komiya  mentioned in the spear eye contact interrogation   he answered like everyone else  kushida   only ugly boys like ike kun and komiya kun come on to her    her taunt reaches him via shinohara s spear","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v5-p172-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Komiya: mentioned in the spear<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V5 · p.172, 206<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Eye-contact interrogation — he answered like everyone else.<span class=\"pg\">p.172<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Kushida: &quot;only ugly boys like Ike-kun and Komiya-kun come on to her&quot; — her taunt reaches him via Shinohara&#x27;s spear.<span class=\"pg\">p.206<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v5-p142-1\">← Before: Komiya: the compliance chorus<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v7-p175-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru yagami-takuya kinoshita-minori mashima-tomonari sakagami komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo komiya at the student council room  identifying yagami  2   komiya showed up with ryuen kun with kinoshita  he stood discreetly behind ryuen  two of ryuen s classmates also showed up  sakagami sensei and mashima sensei also showed up later in the student council room   this is the one you guys were talking about  right    ryuen kun asked komiya kun and the others standing discreetly behind him  confirming something   yes  sir  i m sure of it    komiya  ryuen kun heard this and  with a wan smile on his face as usual  moved even closer to yagami kun   don t play dumb  komiya and kinoshita reminded me just the other day  the reason they got seriously injured during the desert island test was because you violently attacked them    ryuen  severe injuries on a deserted island  they were seriously injured with broken bones  as horikita recalled  an accident caused by carelessness   these guys had lost their memories due to the shock of their injuries  but once it was put away as an accident  they remembered  they remember now that you were the culprit    ryuen  just as he was suspected by them  now he was suspected by student council president nagumo as well   yagami  i know that the gps on your watch was not functioning when the two alerts went off that day  there were several students whose watches were broken during the special exam  but only two  including you  were able to contact komiya and the others from the point where you last disappeared  of course  at the time  komiya  kinoshita  and shinohara could only say that someone had injured them  but they could not give their names  therefore  we had no choice but to treat it as an accident    ryuen  shinohara is named as one of those injured  the fourth injured student  her name is mentioned only in this sentence  ryuen kun gave instructions to komiya kun with his chin to ibuki san  who still could not stand up  and then lent her a hand and left the room  yagami was behind his injury  he and kinoshita remember now  the other of the two injured brought by ryuen to identify yagami  he brought him  he nodded  he never spoke beyond  yes  sir  mashima sensei appeared alongside  yagami kicked the sensei  sakagami watched yagami kick mashima  assists in the exit","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v7-p175-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Komiya at the student council room; identifying Yagami<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.175–176<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">§2 — Komiya showed up with Ryūen-kun with Kinoshita; he stood discreetly behind Ryūen; two of Ryūen&#x27;s classmates also showed up; Sakagami-sensei and Mashima-sensei also showed up later in the student council room.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"yagami-takuya.html\">Yagami Takuya<\/a> · <a href=\"kinoshita-minori.html\">Kinoshita Minori<\/a> · <a href=\"mashima-tomonari.html\">Mashima Tomonari<\/a> · <a href=\"sakagami.html\">Sakagami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> “This is the one you guys were talking about, right?” — Ryūen-kun asked Komiya-kun and the others standing discreetly behind him, confirming something.<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Yes, sir. I&#x27;m sure of it.” — Komiya.<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> “Don&#x27;t play dumb. Komiya and Kinoshita reminded me just the other day. The reason they got seriously injured during the desert island test was because you violently attacked them.” — Ryūen.<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>12 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ryūen-kun heard this and, with a wan smile on his face as usual, moved even closer to Yagami-kun.<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Severe injuries on a deserted island; they were seriously injured with broken bones; as Horikita recalled, an accident caused by carelessness.<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “These guys had lost their memories due to the shock of their injuries, but once it was put away as an accident, they remembered. They remember now that you were the culprit.” — Ryūen.<span class=\"pg\">p.176–177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Just as he was suspected by them, now he was suspected by Student Council President Nagumo as well.<span class=\"pg\">p.176–177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Yagami. I know that the GPS on your watch was not functioning when the two alerts went off that day. There were several students whose watches were broken during the special exam, but only two, including you, were able to contact Komiya and the others from the point where you last disappeared. Of course, at the time, Komiya, Kinoshita, and Shinohara could only say that someone had injured them, but they could not give their names. Therefore, we had no choice but to treat it as an accident…” — Ryūen.<span class=\"pg\">p.177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Shinohara is named as one of those injured; the fourth injured student; her name is mentioned only in this sentence.<span class=\"pg\">p.177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ryūen-kun gave instructions to Komiya-kun with his chin to Ibuki-san, who still could not stand up, and then lent her a hand and left the room.<span class=\"pg\">p.182<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yagami Takuya<\/b> Yagami was behind his injury; he and Kinoshita remember now.<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kinoshita Minori<\/b> The other of the two injured brought by Ryūen to identify Yagami.<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> He brought him; he nodded; he never spoke beyond “Yes, sir.”<span class=\"pg\">p.175–182<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> Mashima-sensei appeared alongside; Yagami kicked the sensei.<span class=\"pg\">p.175–181<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakagami<\/b> Sakagami watched Yagami kick Mashima; assists in the exit.<span class=\"pg\">p.175–182<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v7-p193-1\">→ After: Named as the trick&#x27;s instrument<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v7-p193-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"","w":"komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo named as the trick s instrument  what kind of a trick was used for komiya and the others to name yagami  was it a coincidence that the teacher showed up    ayanokoji s question to nagumo  ayanokoji versus nagumo  ayanokoji arranged the luring  the  next step  is the caller s confirmation that his script was followed","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v7-p193-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Named as the trick&#x27;s instrument<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.193<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “What kind of a trick was used for Komiya and the others to name Yagami? Was it a coincidence that the teacher showed up?” — Ayanokōji&#x27;s question to Nagumo.<span class=\"pg\">p.193<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ayanokōji versus Nagumo: Ayanokōji arranged the luring; the &quot;next step&quot; is the caller&#x27;s confirmation that his script was followed.<span class=\"pg\">p.193<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v7-p175-1\">← Before: Komiya at the student council room; identifying Yagami<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v9-p96-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ishizaki-daichi ryuuen-kakeru komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo komiya  karaoke intrusion with ishizaki he and ishizaki barge into kanzaki s karaoke meeting  claiming they only came to join the singing  kanzaki sees through the excuse and they leave clicking their tongues   oh  oh  we were both at karaoke and i saw you guys  i thought it would be more fun to have a bunch of people singing than just two guys singing in solitude  playfully evasive   helps keep up the pretense that the intrusion is harmless fun  his classmate and partner in the intrusion  the harassment is done on his orders","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v9-p96-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Komiya: karaoke intrusion with Ishizaki<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.96<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He and Ishizaki barge into Kanzaki&#x27;s karaoke meeting, claiming they only came to join the singing; Kanzaki sees through the excuse and they leave clicking their tongues.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Oh, oh. We were both at karaoke and I saw you guys. I thought it would be more fun to have a bunch of people singing than just two guys singing in solitude.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.96<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Playfully evasive — helps keep up the pretense that the intrusion is harmless fun.<span class=\"pg\">p.96<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> His classmate and partner in the intrusion.<span class=\"pg\">p.96<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> The harassment is done on his orders.<span class=\"pg\">p.96<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v12-p177-1","v":"y2v12","y":2,"o":31,"k":"","w":"tamiya-emi komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo ch 8  the eye contact accused named in the first discussion participant list for class c   one of the seven  tamiya claims he and takanashi made eye contact before the discussion started    komiya kun and takanashi were looking at each other just before the discussion started  right  the fifth round proves it   takanashi is the honor student  but komiya is not  komiya and toba are both disclosed as ordinary students by the system reveal   it was revealed that komiya and toba were both ordinary students  he is not the honor student tamiya claimed  she pointed at him as her suspect  she was wrong about him and right about takanashi","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v12-p177-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.8: The eye-contact accused<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12 · p.177–182<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the first-discussion participant list for Class C — one of the seven; Tamiya claims he and Takanashi made eye contact before the discussion started — “Komiya-kun and Takanashi were looking at each other just before the discussion started, right?” The fifth round proves it — Takanashi is the honor student, but Komiya is not; Komiya and Toba are both disclosed as ordinary students by the system reveal.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"tamiya-emi.html\">Tamiya Emi<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “It was revealed that Komiya and Toba were both ordinary students.”; he is not the honor student Tamiya claimed.<span class=\"pg\">p.182<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tamiya Emi<\/b> She pointed at him as her suspect; she was wrong about him and right about Takanashi.<span class=\"pg\">p.178–182<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y3v3-p128-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"morofuji-rika kouenji-rokusuke komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo komiya s bravado and downfall leads class b s ten person e9 supply group  accompanied by vip morofuji   you say he s comin  our way  but it s just one guy  right  some scrub like that doesn t even know where we are  so there s no need to sweat it   see  i told ya you re worryin  too much  if we run into him  i ll put a round right through his heart   where are you  koenji   here  it s over here  huh   why are you attacking us  koenji  overconfident and loud   dismisses the lone koenji as a  scrub  fires his shotgun into the forest to bait him  and is the first cut down  his bragging reveals the group s position  leads the guard group escorting her  taunts him  is eliminated by him first","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y3v3-p128-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Komiya&#x27;s bravado and downfall<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.128–131<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Leads Class B&#x27;s ten-person E9 supply group, accompanied by VIP Morofuji.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"morofuji-rika.html\">Morofuji Rika<\/a> · <a href=\"kouenji-rokusuke.html\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;You say he&#x27;s comin&#x27; our way, but it&#x27;s just one guy, right? Some scrub like that doesn&#x27;t even know where we are, so there&#x27;s no need to sweat it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.128<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;See, I told ya you&#x27;re worryin&#x27; too much. If we run into him, I&#x27;ll put a round right through his heart.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Where are you, Koenji!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Here!? It&#x27;s over here, huh!?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Why are you attacking us, Koenji!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.131<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Overconfident and loud — dismisses the lone Kōenji as a &quot;scrub,&quot; fires his shotgun into the forest to bait him, and is the first cut down; his bragging reveals the group&#x27;s position.<span class=\"pg\">p.128–131<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Morofuji Rika<\/b> Leads the guard group escorting her.<span class=\"pg\">p.128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/b> Taunts him; is eliminated by him first.<span class=\"pg\">p.129–131<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"}];
